<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>热症门 - 标签 | 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%83%AD%E7%97%87%E9%97%A8/</link><description>这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。</description><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-alpha-mt895zhg</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</webMaster><copyright>本站内容采用 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 国际许可协议。</copyright><lastBuildDate>Fri, 03 Jul 2026 09:45:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%83%AD%E7%97%87%E9%97%A8/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>热症门</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/6-5-rezhenmen/</link><pubDate>Fri, 03 Jul 2026 09:40:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/6-5-rezhenmen/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E5%85%AD%E6%95%B0%E9%9B%86/">卷六数集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“热症门”部分，由&lt;strong&gt;雷公真君&lt;/strong&gt;专论&lt;strong&gt;热病发狂如见鬼、热病不知人、火盛舌裂大渴、产后大汗发热&lt;/strong&gt;等热症危候的辨治法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;热症当分虚实，实热宜泻火佐以益气，虚热宜清火兼以滋肝开郁；大热证用甘寒清润以护胃，产后虚热则大补气血以敛汗固脱。治热不远凉，然必顾护正气&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item></channel></rss>